GIVEN `it is dealing with a specified application or a subsequent application under this section` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the Court of Appeal thinks the direction necessary or expedient` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 60I(3) the Court of Appeal may give the direction` MEANS
