        -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "When dealing with any specified application or subsequent application under this section" -- "when" counts as "where" (ruling of 2026-11-05), and it is not met
        IF NOT `it is dealing with a specified application or a subsequent application under this section` THEN JUST FALSE
        IF `the Court of Appeal thinks the direction necessary or expedient` THEN JUST TRUE
        -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): "such directions as the Court of Appeal thinks necessary or expedient"
        OTHERWISE NOTHING

§§ `s 60J -- Court of Appeal may determine whether application is, or action contains, application for PACC permission or PACC application, etc.`

